WEBVTT

00:12:29.828 --> 00:12:33.916
But I learn more from those girls
than I can ever learn from anybody.

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:37.628
The joy of being onstage is different,

00:12:37.628 --> 00:12:41.048
it's planting seeds worldwide

00:12:41.048 --> 00:12:44.009
for people to see their capacity,

00:12:44.051 --> 00:12:45.552
what they are capable of.

00:12:45.594 --> 00:12:48.639
How many times after concert
people will come to me and say,

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:50.724
"Angelique, how can we help?"

00:12:51.225 --> 00:12:53.101
And I'm like, "How can you help?

00:12:53.101 --> 00:12:54.728
Come on.

00:12:54.728 --> 00:12:55.938
Your neighbors.

00:12:55.938 --> 00:12:57.731
Start looking at them.

00:12:57.773 --> 00:13:00.651
You can volunteer your time for homework,